voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_006_霧雨魔理沙.wav","telop":"「そうか…、操夢が言ってた話だと、過去の口座の入出金を調べていたら、何回か不審な履歴があったと言ってたのだぜ…」","duration":5.6000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"第6スライド","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.006.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","voiceDuration":9.326984126984128,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","id":"2AF6050C-EEBD-4943-B7DE-B258B0FC4407"},{"title":"シーン 7","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_博麗霊夢.wav","telop":"私は、その指摘を受け、ズキズキと心に何かが刺さる…。\n「えっと…、それは…」","duration":3.7,"animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"第7スライド","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第6話\/nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a\/交換夫婦（24話目）_df4c9d483a.007.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","transitionName":"クロスディゾルブ","voiceDuration":6.405736961451248,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc374640_電車内・座席・昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","id":"4A5EC46E-2670-4E36-B26E-4074078A5884"},{"title":"シーン 8","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_008_霧雨魔理沙.wav","telop":"「なあ、一つ聞きたいんだけど、\n霊夢の収入が少ないと感じるのは…」","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","slideTitle":"第8スライド","audioTrack":"track_voice_marisa","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\